  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "The planning screens read an item's planning data, and an item that has none is not refused; it is absent, with nothing to explain why. The link is a row for the planning cluster on the item, and MRP plans a BOM component only if the component has planning data of its own, so this phase checks every item in the structure, not just the parent."
      }
